# Prelude to Puissance (jeuno 170), the level cap alone either side of 95: a level 91 Warrior with the Limit Breaker,
# Dormant Powers Dislodged completed. Cap 94 and 96: no section (Beyond Infinity wants Prelude to Puissance completed),
# the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0); cap 95: 10194 (91, 1, 6, 2).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10194
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=91
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 94
quest Jeuno.DormantPowersDislodged completed
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 94: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 96                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 96: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 95                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 95: 10194 (91, 1, 6, 2)
finish                                  # begun
